{"id":"e1b896a0e27f3a8f","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-arithmetic-preimage.md","title":"可计算逆像保持量词层级","display":"thm-arithmetic-preimage — 可计算逆像保持量词层级","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-arithmetic-preimage","aliases":["20-thm-arithmetic-preimage"],"display":"thm-arithmetic-preimage — 可计算逆像保持量词层级","chapter":"4","section":"4.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.1.4(v)","source_printed_pages":[81],"source_pdf_pages":[117],"depends_on":["[[20-df-arith]]","[[20-df-rel-arith]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-arithmetic-preimage"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-arithmetic-preimage</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arithmetic-preimage — 可计算逆像保持量词层级"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.1.4(v)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>81</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>117</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8251b2f9fd838667\" href=\"?note=8251b2f9fd838667\" title=\"20-df-rel-arith\">20-df-rel-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge0\">\\(n\\ge0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,\\ell\\ge1\">\\(k,\\ell\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega^\\ell\\to\\omega^k\">\\(f:\\omega^\\ell\\to\\omega^k\\)</span> 全可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega^k\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega^k\\)</span>；相对版本固定 oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8251b2f9fd838667\" href=\"?note=8251b2f9fd838667\" title=\"20-df-rel-arith\">20-df-rel-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetic-preimage}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\Rightarrow f^{-1}[A]\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,\\ell},\\qquad\nA\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k}\\Rightarrow f^{-1}[A]\\in\\Pi^0_{n,\\ell},\\\\\nA\\in\\Delta^0_{n,k}\\Rightarrow f^{-1}[A]\\in\\Delta^0_{n,\\ell}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetic-preimage}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\Rightarrow f^{-1}[A]\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,\\ell},\\qquad\nA\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k}\\Rightarrow f^{-1}[A]\\in\\Pi^0_{n,\\ell},\\\\\nA\\in\\Delta^0_{n,k}\\Rightarrow f^{-1}[A]\\in\\Delta^0_{n,\\ell}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相对类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^X,\\Pi^X,\\Delta^X\">\\(\\Sigma^X,\\Pi^X,\\Delta^X\\)</span> 同样成立；相对版本还允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>-可计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在前束式的可计算矩阵中把自由元组替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec x)\">\\(f(\\vec x)\\)</span>。矩阵的计算先运行全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，再计算原矩阵，仍在同一可计算基底中；绑定量词及交替数未改变。补集与逆像可交换，故得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> 结论；交两类给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n\">\\(\\Delta_n\\)</span>。全定义前提保证每个输入都有矩阵真值，不能无条件用于部分函数的逆像。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 81 / PDF 117。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-rel-arith","status":"resolved","id":"8251b2f9fd838667","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-rel-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-rel-arith]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-rel-arith","status":"resolved","id":"8251b2f9fd838667","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-rel-arith]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-rel-arith]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge0","display":false},{"tex":"k,\\ell\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega^\\ell\\to\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetic-preimage}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\Rightarrow f^{-1}[A]\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,\\ell},\\qquad\nA\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k}\\Rightarrow f^{-1}[A]\\in\\Pi^0_{n,\\ell},\\\\\nA\\in\\Delta^0_{n,k}\\Rightarrow f^{-1}[A]\\in\\Delta^0_{n,\\ell}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^X,\\Pi^X,\\Delta^X","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_n","display":false}],"bytes":1633,"backlinks":[{"id":"994bce235fe37ad3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]；see [[20-thm-arithstrict]]；see [[20-thm-arithmetic-preimage]]。"}],"outgoing":["832f53dc90c8947a","8251b2f9fd838667","e343870c773cb68e"]}